# 自提核销全链路实测（IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 格式）
# 注意：本工程已升级对接生鲜自提前端规范，统一信封为：{"code":200,"message":"操作成功","msg":"操作成功","data":...}

@base = http://localhost:8080

### 0. 确认服务活着
GET {{base}}/user/pickupPoint/list

### ==============================
### Part A: 生鲜自提前端专用接口实测 (/api/**)
### ==============================

### A1. 字典接口（分类）
GET {{base}}/api/dict?group=dish_category

### A2. 字典接口（金刚区与服务保障）
GET {{base}}/api/dict?group=kingkong_entry

### A3. 自提网点列表
GET {{base}}/api/stores

### A4. 商品列表（支持 category / keyword 过滤）
GET {{base}}/api/dishes?category=meat

### A5. 商品详情
GET {{base}}/api/dishes/1

### A6. 手机号快捷登录（自动签发 Bearer Token，支持新老用户）
# @name apiLogin
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "13800138000", "code": "1234" }

> {% client.global.set("bearerToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### A7. 用户中心
GET {{base}}/api/user/me
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### A8. 前端直接下单（带 orderDetailList / items，免购物车直接提交）
# @name apiOrderSubmit
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

{
  "pickupPointId": 1,
  "pickupPointName": "高黎柱发士多店(请自备袋子谢谢)",
  "pickupTimeSlot": "次日自提 16:00-18:00",
  "consigneeName": "张三",
  "consigneePhone": "13800138000",
  "amount": 599.00,
  "orderDetailList": [
    {
      "name": "Redmi 9A 4GB+128GB",
      "dishId": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "amount": 599.00,
      "image": "/static/images/png/dish-2.png",
      "dishFlavor": "晴空翠 4+128G"
    }
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("apiOrderId", response.body.data.id); %}

### A9. 前端模拟支付并生成 8 位提货码
# @name apiPay
POST {{base}}/api/pay/{{apiOrderId}}/mock-pay
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

> {% client.global.set("apiPickupCode", response.body.data); %}

### A10. 查询订单详情（含提货码与自提点信息）
GET {{base}}/api/orders/{{apiOrderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### A11. 团长核销（首次核销成功，verifyStatus=1）
POST {{base}}/admin/order/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupCode": "{{apiPickupCode}}", "pickupPointId": 1 }

### ==============================
### Part B: 苍穹外卖原有/兼容链路实测
### ==============================

### B1. 模拟登录（mock-login 已开，游客模式的 mock code 也能登）
# @name login
POST {{base}}/user/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "the code is a mock one" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token); %}

### B2. 查自提点（带回 latitude / longitude / image）
GET {{base}}/user/pickupPoint/list

### B3. 模拟支付 → 返回 8 位提货码
# @name pay
POST {{base}}/user/order/{{apiOrderId}}/mock-pay
token: {{token}}

### B4. 订单详情
GET {{base}}/user/order/orderDetail/{{apiOrderId}}
token: {{token}}

### B5. 重复核销（应报「该订单已核销，不能重复领货」）
POST {{base}}/admin/order/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupCode": "{{apiPickupCode}}", "pickupPointId": 1 }

### B6. 错误码格式（应报格式不正确）
POST {{base}}/admin/order/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupCode": "ABC123" }

### B7. 不存在的码
POST {{base}}/admin/order/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pickupCode": "99999999" }

